{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/ade1462453303a15394803637c2b8497.poster.avif?t=1770583012\" width=712 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/ade1462453303a15394803637c2b8497.webm?t=1770583012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/ade1462453303a15394803637c2b8497.mp4?t=1770583012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Rush Ventures throws you into the gold rush era: explore endless mines, uncover hidden outposts and abandoned structures. Live an adventure where every descent could mean a fortune\u2026 or your life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/f6fefefc2186487476b9b03dcbd4e68f.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your descent carefully, avoid deadly crevices, and make sure you have enough energy to return to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remembering the right path will also be crucial for your survival. <br>The mines are full of dangers, so come prepared by stocking up in the shops of Desert Creek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomly generated mines and their structures. Discovering an abandoned outpost with a few resources left inside could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/9a35e167a51ae605a336d045595b0b41.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span>Complete missions for the various inhabitants of Desert Creek. Earn the trust of merchants to gain access to better items and unlock the final questline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the NPCs\u2019 daily routines so you won\u2019t be caught off guard by a closed shop, and always stay one step ahead in your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/563102fa1d457759a10e6ba4b1cdf904.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig ever deeper, uncovering increasingly rare and valuable minerals and gems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the different underground layers carefully, as each level hides new challenges and rewards. Hone your mining skills to discover treasures that others can only dream of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/c6315e88a3900c333b73973e5ea7ca91.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure you can return to the surface with all your treasures by building proper mining infrastructure. Use everything at your disposal: ladders, ropes, bridges, torches, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish outposts deep underground or take over abandoned ones. A well-built and secure mine is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/1a7d2639078ce068d65a7a8ad3312bdd.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span><br>  The game is sill in active development!<br>Support the project by adding it in your wish list!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991550?t=1770583012","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991550?t=1770583012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/8c6ad10a9630850ecf56a5bf37ec8d1fffc4728d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770583012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/8c6ad10a9630850ecf56a5bf37ec8d1fffc4728d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770583012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/ade1462453303a15394803637c2b8497.poster.avif?t=1770583012\" width=712 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/ade1462453303a15394803637c2b8497.webm?t=1770583012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/ade1462453303a15394803637c2b8497.mp4?t=1770583012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Rush Ventures throws you into the gold rush era: explore endless mines, uncover hidden outposts and abandoned structures. Live an adventure where every descent could mean a fortune\u2026 or your life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/f6fefefc2186487476b9b03dcbd4e68f.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your descent carefully, avoid deadly crevices, and make sure you have enough energy to return to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remembering the right path will also be crucial for your survival. <br>The mines are full of dangers, so come prepared by stocking up in the shops of Desert Creek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomly generated mines and their structures. Discovering an abandoned outpost with a few resources left inside could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/9a35e167a51ae605a336d045595b0b41.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span>Complete missions for the various inhabitants of Desert Creek. Earn the trust of merchants to gain access to better items and unlock the final questline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the NPCs\u2019 daily routines so you won\u2019t be caught off guard by a closed shop, and always stay one step ahead in your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/563102fa1d457759a10e6ba4b1cdf904.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig ever deeper, uncovering increasingly rare and valuable minerals and gems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the different underground layers carefully, as each level hides new challenges and rewards. Hone your mining skills to discover treasures that others can only dream of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/c6315e88a3900c333b73973e5ea7ca91.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure you can return to the surface with all your treasures by building proper mining infrastructure. Use everything at your disposal: ladders, ropes, bridges, torches, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish outposts deep underground or take over abandoned ones. A well-built and secure mine is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/extras/1a7d2639078ce068d65a7a8ad3312bdd.avif?t=1770583012\" width=1024 height=185 /></span><br>  The game is sill in active development!<br>Support the project by adding it in your wish list!</p>","developers":["Alessio Bertolacci"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991550/81651878dc8f17e13519aec3420581d68f37ec35/header.jpg?t=1770583012","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991550/1641004922/e58feaa135c2b324ebf63bbe775ddf264f2b5e54/1762438099/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762438435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991550/1641004922/e58feaa135c2b324ebf63bbe775ddf264f2b5e54/1762438099/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762438435","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991550/1641004922/e58feaa135c2b324ebf63bbe775ddf264f2b5e54/1762438099/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762438435","id":257193132,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193132/f08bb05e88caffe56b0fa7bc14df16f1a7b0015d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762438435"}],"name":"Gold Rush Ventures","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon R7 370<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sto